            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I've just noticed from video replay that you seem to have 'mini.icons' installed (with probably executed `MiniIcons.tweak_lsp_kind()`), but there is no highlighting. I do get conflicting default icon and highlighting in this case (as entries with tweaked `vim.lsp.protocol.SymbolKind` are not recognized in `MiniIcons.get()`), which I'll try to fix that soon-ish. Still, no such behavior as on video.",
