        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I do get conflicting default icon and highlighting in this case (as entries with tweaked `vim.lsp.protocol.SymbolKind` are not recognized in `MiniIcons.get()`), which I'll try to fix that soon-ish.\r\n\r\nThis should now be resolved on latest `main`. `pickers.lsp` with 'document_symbol' and 'workspace_symbol' scopes now properly work after `MiniIcons.tweak_lsp_kind()` (no extra icon yet proper highlighting). Maybe this will also fix the issue in the original comment.",
