        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for fixing, however I completely overhaul my Neovim config to use `MiniDeps` as the main plugin manager (I like the vim-plug declaration style). The problem does not appear anymore so I suspect a possible loading order issue with `lazy`, which is too complex under the hood to understand. \r\n\r\nBtw, thank you for the work on `mini.nvim`, the modules are just brilliant and hands down the best I have ever used.",
